      "beat_id": "B06",
      "act": "II — Orchestration",
      "estimated_duration_s": 21,
      "narration_text": "Turn a vague goal into measurable targets, then watch the metrics — latency, token spend, step count. When one drifts several standard deviations from expected, a drift analyser decides whether it is a one-off failure or the environment itself changing. The trap is goals that conflict: speed against cost, deadlocking.",
