    {
      "beat_id": "B07",
      "act": "IV — Fail-safes",
      "estimated_duration_s": 22,
      "narration_text": "Classify the error before you react to it. Temporary means back off exponentially and retry. Permanent means fall back to something simpler and deterministic. Critical means stop and fetch a human. And alert only on that last one — paging an engineer for every silent retry is exactly how alerts start getting ignored.",
