    {
      "beat_id": "B08",
      "act": "IV — Fail-safes",
      "estimated_duration_s": 21,
      "narration_text": "The agent pauses at a checkpoint — a low-confidence call, a regulated decision, a large transfer — and asks a person. The engineering problem is not the prompt. It is suspending state indefinitely without leaking resources while a review queue waits. And your latency is now bound to human response time.",
